> </div> </fieldset> </form> </li> </ul> </div> <div id=\"block-copotrebujetecz\"> <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"> <div class=\"user-item help-item\" id=\"help-item-form\"> <a class=\"user-item-nav-link\" id=\"helpitem\" href=\"\" aria-label=\"zobrazit okno rychl\u00e9 n\u00e1pov\u011bdy\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#helpItemModal\"><i class=\"bi bi-info-circle\"></i><span>Co pot\u0159ebujete?</span></a> </div> </div> </div> <div id=\"block-menutlacitkovhlaviccecz\"> <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"> <div class=\"user-item menu-item\" id=\"menu-item-form\"> <a class=\"user-item-nav-link\" id=\"menu\" href=\"\" aria-label=\"rozbalit hlavn\u00ed navigaci webu\"><i class=\"bi bi-list\"></i><span>Menu</span></a> </div> </div> </div> </nav> </div> </header> <main> <div class=\"content-page-header bgimg\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"page-top\"> <div class=\"crumb\"> <div id=\"block-star-cgs-breadcrumbs\"> <div class=\"crumb\"> <a href=\"/\">Dom\u016f</a> <i class=\"bi bi-chevron-right\"></i> Copyright </div> </div> </div> <div id=\"block-star-cgs-page-title\"> <h1 class=\"marker\"><span>Copyright</span> </h1> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"content-block\"> <div class=\"container fr\"> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div> </div> </div> <div id=\"block-star-cgs-content\"> <div class=\"content-block \"> <div class=\"container mobile-only\"> <nav class=\"mobile-tabs fr\"> <ul> <li><span data-target=\".content-inside\" class=\"active\">Obsah</span></li> <li><span data-target=\"aside\">Souvisej\u00edc\u00ed</span></li> </ul> </nav> </div> <div class=\"container sidebar-included fr\"> <div class=\"content-inside active\"> <section class=\"page\"> <div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--body paragraph--view-mode--default\"> <div class=\"field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"> <p>V\u0161echny materi\u00e1ly poch\u00e1zej\u00edc\u00ed z produkce \u010cesk\u00e9 geologick\u00e9 slu\u017eby uve\u0159ejn\u011bn\u00e9 na tomto webu jsou p\u0159edm\u011btem autorsk\u00e9 ochrany. Jejich vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00ed nebo reprodukce je mo\u017en\u00e1 pouze s p\u00edsemn\u00fdm souhlasem \u010cesk\u00e9 geologick\u00e9 slu\u017eby.</p> <p>P\u0159\u00edpadnou \u017e\u00e1dost o vyu\u017eit\u00ed materi\u00e1l\u016f nebo jejich \u010d\u00e1st\u00ed z webu \u010cesk\u00e9 geologick\u00e9 slu\u017eby adresujte na:<br> \u010cesk\u00e1 geologick\u00e1 slu\u017eba<br> Kl\u00e1rov 3<br> 118 00 Praha 1</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--body paragraph--view-mode--default\"> <div class=\"field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"> <h2>Citace mapov\u00fdch aplikac\u00ed</h2> <p>Kdykoliv \u0161\u00ed\u0159\u00edte <strong>v\u00fd\u0159ez mapy nebo jeho \u00fapravu</strong>, uve\u010fte pros\u00edm <strong>citaci ve tvaru</strong>:</p> <p>&lt;n\u00e1zvy zobrazen\u00fdch mapov\u00fdch vrstev&gt;. In: &lt;n\u00e1zev mapov\u00e9 aplikace&gt; [online]. Praha: \u010cesk\u00e1 geologick\u00e1 slu\u017eba [cit. &lt;datum zobrazen\u00ed&gt;]. Dostupn\u00e9 z: &lt;webov\u00e1 adresa mapov\u00e9 aplikace&gt;</p> <p><strong>P\u0159\u00edklad:</strong> <em>Vrtn\u00e1 prozkoumanost, Geologick\u00e1 mapa 1 : 50 000. In: Geov\u011bdn\u00ed mapy 1 : 50 000 [online]. Praha: \u010cesk\u00e1 geologick\u00e1 slu\u017eba [cit. 2018-03-21]. Dostupn\u00e9 z: https://mapy.geology.cz/geocr50/</em></p> <p>Pokud \u0161\u00ed\u0159\u00edte upraven\u00e9 d\u00edlo, je t\u0159eba tak\u00e9 uv\u00e9st zp\u016fsob, jak\u00fdm jste d\u00edlo upravili.</p> <h2>Citace mapov\u00fdch slu\u017eeb pou\u017eit\u00fdch v&nbsp;jin\u00fdch aplikac\u00edch</h2> <p>Pokud vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1te <strong>mapovou slu\u017ebu jako roz\u0161i\u0159uj\u00edc\u00ed obsah jin\u00e9 mapov\u00e9 aplikace</strong>, uve\u010fte pros\u00edm <strong>citaci ve tvaru</strong>:</p> <p>&lt;n\u00e1zvy zobrazen\u00fdch mapov\u00fdch vrstev&gt;. In: &lt;n\u00e1zev mapov\u00e9 aplikace&gt; [online]. Praha: \u010cesk\u00e1 geologick\u00e1 slu\u017eba [cit. &lt;datum zobrazen\u00ed&gt;]. Dostupn\u00e9 z: &lt;webov\u00e1 adresa mapov\u00e9 aplikace&gt;</p> <p><strong>P\u0159\u00edklad:</strong> <em>D\u016fln\u00ed d\u00edla, Geoterm\u00e1ln\u00ed mapy. In: Geoterm\u00e1ln\u00ed potenci\u00e1l \u010cR [online]. Praha: \u010cesk\u00e1 geologick\u00e1 slu\u017eba [cit. 2023-08-08]. Dostupn\u00e9 z: https://mapy.geology.cz/geotermalni_potencial/</em></p> <h2>Citace datov\u00e9 sady</h2> <p><strong>Data</strong> ulo\u017een\u00e1 v&nbsp;Centr\u00e1ln\u00edm datov\u00e9m skladu \u010cGS, <strong>kter\u00e1 jsou ji\u017e publikov\u00e1na</strong>, se <strong>cituj\u00ed podle publikace a zpr\u00e1vy</strong>, v kter\u00e9 byla uve\u0159ejn\u011bna.</p> <p><strong>P\u0159\u00edklad:</strong> <em>HAN\u017dL, P. et al. (2007): Vysv\u011btlivky k z\u00e1kladn\u00ed geologick\u00e9 map\u011b \u010cR 1 : 25 000, list 24-322 Blansko. 70 s. \u010cesk\u00e1 geologick\u00e1 slu\u017eba. Praha. ISBN 978-80-7075-680-5.</em></p> <p><strong>Data</strong> ulo\u017een\u00e1 v CDS \u010cGS, kter\u00e1 jsou <strong>sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed d\u00edl\u010d\u00ed autorsk\u00e9 datab\u00e1ze</strong>, jsou <strong>citov\u00e1na pod jm\u00e9nem autora</strong>, kter\u00fd tuto datab\u00e1zi sestavil a p\u0159edal do CDS. Citovan\u00fd rok je stanoven rokem kompletizace dat, pop\u0159. p\u0159eveden\u00edm dat do CDS. [citov\u00e1no 2021-10-20]=[datum v\u00fdb\u011bru dat z datab\u00e1ze]</p> <p><strong>P\u0159\u00edklad:</strong> <em>SHRBEN\u00dd, O. (1998): Datab\u00e1ze terci\u00e9rn\u00edch vulkanit\u016f \u010cesk\u00e9ho masivu [datab\u00e1ze online]. Praha, \u010cGS, [citov\u00e1no 2023-08-20], Dostupn\u00e9 z URL &lt; http://www.geology.cz/app/legenda/litog.pl&gt;, Litogeochemick\u00e1 datab\u00e1ze \u010cesk\u00e9 geologick\u00e9 slu\u017eby.</em></p> <h2>Licence datov\u00e9 sady INSPIRE</h2> <p>V\u0161echny datov\u00e9 sady jsou k dispozici ke sta\u017een\u00ed pod licenc\u00ed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/deed.cs\" rel=\" noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Creative Commons BY 4.0 (Uve\u010fte P\u016fvod Mezin\u00e1rodn\u00ed).</a> Kdykoliv licencovan\u00e9ho d\u00edlo nebo jeho \u00fapravu \u0161\u00ed\u0159\u00edte, je nutno uv\u00e9st \u00fadaje o autorovi a p\u016fvodu ve tvaru</p> <p>(CC BY 4.0) \u010cesk\u00e1 geologick\u00e1 slu\u017eba.</p> <p>Pokud \u0161\u00ed\u0159\u00edte upraven\u00e9 d\u00edlo, je t\u0159eba tak\u00e9 uv\u00e9st zp\u016fsob, jak\u00fdm jste d\u00edlo upravili.</p> </div> </div> </section> </div> <aside class=\"sticked\"> <div class=\"sidebar-container\"> <div class=\"sidebar-box\"> <span class=\"title\"> Kontakt </span> <div class=\"field field--name-field-contact-contacts field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__items\"> <div class=\"field__item\"><div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-md-12\"> <p> <a href=\"/personal/jan-sedlacek\"> Ing. Jan Sedl\u00e1\u010dek </a> </p> <p> \u010cesk\u00e1 geologick\u00e1 slu\u017eba<br /> Kl\u00e1rov 131/3<br /> 118 00 Praha 1 <br/> </p> <p><a href=\"tel: +420 602 206 291\">+420 602 206 291</a></p> <p><a href=\"tel: +420 257 089 483\">+420 257 089 483</a></p> <p><a href=\"mailto: jan.sedlacek@geology.cz\">jan.sedlacek@geology.cz</a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"content-block\"> <div class=\"container fr\"> </div> </div> <div class=\"back-to-top\"> <span> <i class=\"bi bi-chevron-double-up\"></i> </span> </div> </main> <footer> <div class=\"footer fr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div id=\"block-star-cgs-patickageology\"> <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"> <div class=\"heel\"> <div class=\"item item--credit\"> <img src=\"/themes/star_cgs/assets/img/cgslogo-w